{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>面對社群媒體與網頁資訊爆炸，傳統書籤常陷入雜亂無章的困境。FavPicks 為一款專注於高效收集與整理連結的智能應用，特別適合追求極簡主義、希望精準掌握個人興趣軌跡的使用者。目前該 App 正提供終生版限時免費領取機會，讓用戶能零成本享受進階功能。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-15.webp\">\n<h2>智能聚合多平台連結</h2>\n<p>本應用打破平台界限，自動將來自 YouTube、Instagram、Reddit 等多個社交平台的連結與圖片整合至單一時間軸。其核心設計強調「少即是多」，預設每日僅允許儲存五項內容，強制用戶在瀏覽大量資訊時進行篩選與思考。透過這種剋制的收藏機制，時間軸將真實反映使用者長期累積的品味與偏好，而非成為數位垃圾堆。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-84-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-85-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-86-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-87-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-88-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>FavPicks:bookmarks manager 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FavPicks:bookmarks manager</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T21:58:52.061998+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":473,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T21:44:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T11:38:09.570354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T21:57:36.433477+00:00","content_hash":"f6a70849e9dd8e21c9368ae793770811dc7ec4c8c45b7c62c84d1315b48f1dd4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}